{"id":"n72310-1-7","stage":4,"title":"일거양득 · 一举两得","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72310-1-7-1","ko":"술을 끊었더니 건강도 좋아지고 아내랑 사이도 좋아졌어.","zh":"我戒酒之后，身体变好了，和妻子的关系也更好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"술을","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끊었더니","meaning":"戒","explanation":"끊다：戒；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"끊다","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62839","senseId":"4","lemma":"끊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건강도","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아지고","meaning":"好，亲，和睦，美满；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"좋다：好，亲，和睦，美满；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"16","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아내랑","meaning":"妻子，爱人，老婆","explanation":"아내：妻子，爱人，老婆；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"아내","audio":"/audio/3611acca94af861ef852.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30196","senseId":"1","lemma":"아내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이도","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아졌어.","meaning":"好，亲，和睦，美满；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"좋다：好，亲，和睦，美满；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"16","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"c2d51c5ca94e5957","term":"끊다","zh":"戒","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3","entryId":"62839","definition":"不再做习惯性的行为。","pronunciation":["끈타"]},{"id":"b9e697a6a3627e47","term":"건강","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3","entryId":"36670","definition":"指身体或精神没有异常、很结实的状态。","pronunciation":["건ː강"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，亲，和睦，美满","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"相互亲近、亲密。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"3611acca94af861e","term":"아내","zh":"妻子，爱人，老婆","audio":"/audio/3611acca94af861ef852.mp3","entryId":"30196","definition":"结婚而成为男子的配偶的女人。","pronunciation":["아내"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]}],"audio":"/audio/24cb532636166f7b3ab7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72310-1-7-2","ko":"그거야말로 일거양득이네.","zh":"那可真是双赢啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그거야말로","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个；야말로：特别强调：“才真是、正是”。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일거양득이네.","meaning":"一举两得","explanation":"일거양득：一举两得；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"일거양득","audio":"/audio/ddd072bcc140fca658e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72310","senseId":"1","lemma":"일거양득","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"ddd072bcc140fca6","term":"일거양득","zh":"一举两得","audio":"/audio/ddd072bcc140fca658e1.mp3","entryId":"72310","definition":"做一件事得到两种好处。","pronunciation":["일거양득"]}],"audio":"/audio/86d7e034df5bf46bd091.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.536,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72310","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我戒酒之后，身体变好了，和妻子的关系也更好了。","那可真是双赢啊。","别打断我说话。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我戒酒之后，身体变好了，和妻子的关系也更好了。","那可真是双赢啊。","别打断我说话。"],"answer":1}]}
